{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "834639f9-8bea-81cf-8f60-4c020abed6f4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T10:16:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I want to put up a fence. Do I need a permit for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:12:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a fence usually needs a permit, but it depends on a few things. Can you tell me a little about what you're planning? Height, material, where it goes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stockade style. Cedar. Four feet tall. It's along the side that faces the road. It's a busy road, lots of traffic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is this a property you own, or are you renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Renting. The landlord said it's fine with him. I'm the one who wants it. The noise and the headlights are getting to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. What's the address, so I can see what the lot looks like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty-nine Rhode Island Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty-nine Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill. Okay. Is the fence going right on the property line, or set back from it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Set back a little from the sidewalk. Not on the line with the neighbor. The neighbor's side is the other way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:13:55-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the fence would face the street. With a street-facing fence, the placement matters, especially near the corner or the driveway, because of sight lines. And since you're a tenant, the owner would normally be the one to apply, or at least sign off on the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:14:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He can do that. Does the neighbor have to be notified?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a fence like that, I wouldn't expect a notice to the neighbor to be the main requirement. But it's a good idea to let them know, and if anything gets near the shared line, that changes things. The permit office can confirm that when the application goes in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's a maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the neighbor part, yes, it's a maybe until we see the plan. The permit part is a pretty firm yes. You'd want a simple sketch showing where the fence goes and how far from the street and the lot lines."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. I can do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Is this in a historic district? Because up on the Hill, some blocks have extra review."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know. It's Historic Hill, so probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'll note that. It may need a look from the historic side as well, which can add time. Can I get a number in case someone needs to call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven nine. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "David Rahman. R-A-H-M-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Rahman. Have the owner contact us, or you can come by with the sketch and his information. I'll flag that you called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I've had the same tune stuck in my head all morning and this is the first thing I've gotten done today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:15:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a start. Sounds like the weather is turning out there too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:16:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's coming down now. Okay. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
